// grmb design corpus. Hand-written against docs/design/grmb-spec.md (cycle 1
// grammar); NOT machine-checked (the P1 parser predates cycle 1). Findings below
// are what the rules of that file predict, to be confirmed by P0/P1.
// Stress 14: whole model in draft with sorry holes, then promoted
//
// EXPECTED FINDINGS
//   Draft: PLAN015 Warn on each sorry; `grimble status --sorry` lists them; dependents tainted
//   Promote to release: PLAN015 becomes Error until each sorry is filled
//   The sorry-bodied impl: PLAN004 and PLAN005 absent (suppressed for the
//   one PLAN015, grmb-spec 15.3); no MDL finding
//   PLAN006 on buyer.pays.ok and buyer.pays.declined (pairs are not the
//   impl's obligations); PLAN005 on pay (no verified_by)
//   The sorry-bodied scenario refund: PLAN001 absent on buyer.refund
//   (covered, tainted); PLAN015; no MDL026
//   The sorry element in ship: PLAN015; no MDL024 (Out(sorry) is Unknown, so the
//   link after it is Unresolved); no Succ pair across it; PLAN003 on
//   (buyer.ships, ship); PLAN005 on ship
// NOT EXPRESSIBLE (open questions: docs/design/grmb-spec.md 19)

scenario pay realizes buyer.pay {
  buyer.pays => { ok => end ok; declined => sorry because="policy TBD" ticket="T-0042"; }
}
impl buyer.pays for pay sorry;
scenario refund realizes buyer.refund sorry;
scenario ship realizes buyer.ship { buyer.ships -> sorry -> end ok; }
